        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also aim to further develop our foundry products, such as value-added inoculants and customized nodularizers, which are used in the production of iron to improve their tensile strength, ductility and impact properties.",
